WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.290
A follow-up is useful when another person needs to act after your shift.

00:00:04.290 --> 00:00:07.570
Open Resolution Center and find Resolution Log.

00:00:07.570 --> 00:00:10.420
Change the entry type from Note to Follow-up.

00:00:10.420 --> 00:00:14.310
Name the person or team responsible and the next check they should make.

00:00:14.310 --> 00:00:17.730
Submit the entry and look for the follow-up label in the log.

00:00:17.730 --> 00:00:20.860
This records a handoff; it does not change the owner.
